{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"The code path records `within-limit` only for a follow-up naming a limit in the bundle; the closeout gate then requires that ID to be sealed and the finding to carry a reason. I’m probing the edge cases around what counts as a reason and whether the lint catches malformed declarations, alongside the specified regression tests."}}
